Task 1: Get Current Logged-in User
Create endpoint: GET /api/auth/me
Fetch current user using UserManager
Return user details (Email, Username)
Protect with [Authorize]

Task 2: Logout User
Create endpoint: POST /api/auth/logout
Use SignInManager.SignOutAsync()
Return success message

Task 3: Change Password
Create endpoint: POST /api/auth/change-password
Accept CurrentPassword and NewPassword
Use ChangePasswordAsync()
Require authenticated user [Authorize]